        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx Wind power plant 30kW, moving parts</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Wind power plant 30kW, moving parts
Lifetime is assumed to be 20 years. Annual electricity production is assumed to be 21 MWh. Data are from a specific wind power plant, installed 1990 on Simplon, Switzerland.;
UUID: b7dbb308-fc7d-37b0-bf58-b82d1b8077cb
Includes materials used for moving parts: rotor, nacelle, electric parts, and their disposal. Also includes the prozessing, the energy requirements for assembling, the transports needed, and  the connection to the grid. 
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Data for a specific Swiss 30 kW wind power plant, installed in the year 1990.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_b7dbb308-fc7d-37b0-bf58-b82d1b8077cb.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
